@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome

title 适老化打车平台 - 用例图 (Use Case Diagram)

actor "老年用户\n(Elderly User)" as Elderly #LightBlue
actor "司机\n(Driver)" as Driver #LightGreen
actor "亲友用户\n(Family Member)" as Family #LightYellow

rectangle "适老化打车平台\n(Elderly Taxi Platform)" {
    usecase "UC1: 一键叫车\n(One-Tap Ride)" as UC1
    usecase "UC2: 语音叫车\n(Voice Command Ride)" as UC2
    usecase "UC3: 扫码叫车\n(Scan QR Code Ride)" as UC3
    usecase "UC4: 电话叫车\n(Hotline Ride)" as UC4
    usecase "UC5: 查看行程状态\n(Check Ride Status)" as UC5
    usecase "UC6: 设置大字模式\n(Large Text Settings)" as UC6
    usecase "UC7: 亲友代付\n(Family Payment)" as UC7
    usecase "UC8: 现金支付\n(Cash Payment)" as UC8
    usecase "UC9: 行程安全守护\n(Trip Safety Guard)" as UC9
    usecase "UC10: 紧急求助\n(Emergency SOS)" as UC10
    usecase "UC11: 就医优先派单\n(Medical Priority Dispatch)" as UC11
    usecase "UC12: 接单\n(Accept Order)" as UC12
    usecase "UC13: 导航\n(Navigation)" as UC13
    usecase "UC14: 代付确认\n(Confirm Payment)" as UC14
    usecase "UC15: 行程查看/管理\n(View Trip History)" as UC15
}

Elderly --> UC1
Elderly --> UC2
Elderly --> UC3
Elderly --> UC4
Elderly --> UC5
Elderly --> UC6
Elderly --> UC7
Elderly --> UC8
Elderly --> UC9
Elderly --> UC10
Elderly --> UC11

Driver --> UC12
Driver --> UC13

Family --> UC9
Family --> UC14
Family --> UC15

UC7 ..> UC14 : <<include>>
UC9 ..> UC15 : <<extend>>

note right of UC2
  支持语音指令：
  - "我要打车回家"
  - "打车去[地点]"
  - "取消叫车"
  - 新增：低置信度候选列表
end note

note right of UC3
  暖心车站/社区二维码
  线下场景入口
  降低APP使用门槛
end note

note right of UC4
  95128热线/客服代叫
  服务无智能手机老人
end note

note bottom of UC6
  字体缩放 1.0x - 2.0x
  高对比度模式
end note

note bottom of UC1
  预填家庭地址
  一键完成叫车
end note

note right of UC9
  实时位置共享给亲友
  上车前车牌号校验
  解决"上错车"焦虑
end note

note right of UC10
  SOS一键求助
  110/120联动
  行程录音启动
end note
@enduml
